REMARK 200 REMARK: THIS IS THE FINAL MODEL OBTAINED AFTER COMBINING TWO         
REMARK 200  COMPLETE DATA SETS, COLLECTED FROM TWO DIFFERENT                    
REMARK 200  CRYSTALS.  TWO OTHER MODELS OBTAINED BY REFINING AGAINST            
REMARK 200  THE INDIVIDUAL DATA SETS WERE USED TO ESTIMATE ATOMIC               
REMARK 200  COORDINATE ERRORS FOR THIS FINAL MODEL.  THIS MODEL AND             
REMARK 200  THE CORRESPONDING STRUCTURE FACTORS ARE OF UNUSUALLY HIGH           
REMARK 200  QUALITY FOR THIS RESOLUTION (1.9 ANGSTROMS), WITH 97%               
REMARK 200  COMPLETENESS, 9.1 FOLD REDUNDANCY (TWO DATA SETS COMBINED)          
REMARK 200  AND HIGH QUALITY X-RAY SOURCE (SYNCHROTRON).  THE                   
REMARK 200  COORDINATE ERROR IN THE FINAL MODEL, ESTIMATED FROM                 
REMARK 200  COMPARING THE TWO INDEPENDENTLY REFINED MODELS WAS 0.08             
REMARK 200  ANGSTROMS FOR PROTEIN ATOMS, 0.07 ANGSTROMS FOR MAIN CHAIN,         
REMARK 200  0.09 ANGSTROMS FOR SIDE CHAINS.  THE OTHER TWO MODELS AND           
REMARK 200  THE CORRESPONDING DATA SETS HAVE BEEN DEPOSITED SEPARATELY.         
